  "reproduce": [
    "Use the four-floor CFG from 2026-11-22-packed-word-replay.json. Run dive check Elevator.tla --config four-floor.cfg --workers 1 --seed 0 --fp 0 --max-memory 8g --time-limit 100s --output json. Save .counterexample.trace as JSON.",
    "Use scripts/perf/scale/elevator-lift-word.py on the original donor with the four increasing floors [1+i*(n-1)//3 for i in range(4)]. Set FloorCount=n in the donor CFG. Reported word hash is Python SHA-256(json.dumps(word,sort_keys=True).encode()).",
    "Run /usr/bin/time -f \"%e %M\" dive validate-trace Elevator.tla --config target.cfg --trace word.json --output json. For damage set only ending.back_to=0.",
    "For changed fairness add Drop(c) == /\\ c \\in ActiveElevatorCalls /\\ ActiveElevatorCalls' = {} /\\ UNCHANGED <<PersonState, ElevatorState>> before DispatchElevator(c) and replace only SF_Vars(DispatchElevator(c)) by SF_Vars(Drop(c)). Original Init, Next, property, CFG and supplied word are preserved."
  ],
